WEBVTT

00:02:28.561 --> 00:02:30.231
AM: Obvious, isn't it?

00:02:30.608 --> 00:02:33.786
Four months later, this artist --

00:02:33.810 --> 00:02:35.786
PA: and this organizer --

00:02:35.810 --> 00:02:41.834
AM: moved into a little home
with a big backyard, in Miami.

00:02:42.636 --> 00:02:43.981
PA: (Sighs)

00:02:44.005 --> 00:02:46.650
Listen, five months
before this ever happened,

00:02:46.674 --> 00:02:47.909
I predicted it all.

00:02:47.933 --> 00:02:49.084
I'm going to tell you --

00:02:49.108 --> 00:02:50.581
a friend sat me down and said,

00:02:50.605 --> 00:02:52.332
"You've done so much for organizing,

00:02:52.356 --> 00:02:54.071
when are you going to settle down?"

00:02:54.095 --> 00:02:55.705
I looked him straight in the face

00:02:55.729 --> 00:02:58.187
and I said, "The only way
that it would ever happen

00:02:58.211 --> 00:02:59.385
is if it is a collision.

00:02:59.409 --> 00:03:02.666
This woman would have to knock me
completely off course."